hi I'm Evan Carmichael welcome to  another edition of ask Evan where I  answer your questions today I'm gonna  answer a question from Valerie who's  asking about how to set up a home-based  business so she wrote in saying hi Evan  and it's kind of a long email but she's  from the Netherlands and she wrote in  the reason why I wanted to personally  mail you is because I'd like to ask if  you can give me advice and what I can do  to start my own business from home so  thanks for the question Valerie it's a  great question a lot of people are  having that that same question for their  own thinking either to have a full-time  business from home or something to  support yourself part-time there's a lot  of opportunities I think the thing you  want to look at though is make sure it's  something that you're really passionate  about and this is where most  entrepreneurs will fall down the look at  different home-based business ideas or  network marketing opportunities and it's  not necessarily anything wrong with them  it's just that it's got to be something  that you believe in most people pick up  a product or start a business because  they're trying to make a lot of money  and if you look at the most successful  entrepreneurs they didn't start their  business to make a lot of money it's a  byproduct of being successful but they  started their business because they had  a strong passion for what they're doing  and they really wanted to help people so  you can make money in any industry and  you can make money from home and in the  industry the key though is that you're  doing something that you're really  excited about and you feel you can tell  your own story and and really help other  people so look at any of those products  look at what you're already using and  see if there's any way that you can  promote that online do they have an  affiliate program that you can sign up  for on the web if you're looking at  different home-based opportunities that  are online you want to look at is this  something that has some meaning to you  right when you're trying to promote  something online you want to be able to  tell your story and how it's helped you  and how it can potentially help others  if you're just you know spamming people  it's not gonna really have a lot of  impact and you see a lot of the guys who  don't have success with network  marketing or home-based businesses it's  because they don't have a true  connection to what they're doing they're  just trying to make money but they're  not really actually helping people so  look at where you solve frustrations for  yourself in the past how you been able  to help other people in the past and how  you can potentially continue to do that  from home  or online in a meaningful way and from  there you'll be able to generate a  business so I'm sorry I can't give you a  specific answer to say go start this  business because it really depends write  the business out that I would be  successful I'd is probably different  than the one that you would be  successful at because we have different  interests different passions but it's  got to be something that you're really  strongly passionate about you care  deeply about and you feel you can have  added value to other people and make a  meaningful difference in their lives for  me I love helping entrepreneurs and so  everything I do almost is around helping  entrepreneurs I make these videos I do a  lot of stuff on the web a lot of stuff  you don't even get paid to do it it's  just because I really have a strong  passion to help entrepreneurs it's what  gets me going in the morning I love  seeing responses come in and and knowing  that I'm having an impact helping people  with their businesses for you it could  be something completely different right  maybe you love recipes or you love cats  or you love helping people with  insurance or whatever it is a lot of  different opportunities out there but  it's got to be something that you really  f